<div class="page-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">USER MANAGEMENT</p><h1>Pengguna</h1><p class="page-subtitle">Buat akun, tentukan role, dan kelola status akses pengguna.</p></div><span class="admin-indicator"><span class="security-dot"></span> Admin only</span></div>
<div class="users-layout"><section class="panel user-create-panel"><div class="panel-heading"><div><h2>Tambah Pengguna</h2><p>Akun baru wajib mengganti password saat login pertama.</p></div></div><form method="post" class="form-stack"> <?= mc_csrf_field() ?><input type="hidden" name="action" value="create_user"><div class="field-group"><label>Nama lengkap <span>*</span></label><input class="input-control" name="full_name" maxlength="120" required placeholder="Nama pengguna"></div><div class="field-group"><label>Username <span>*</span></label><input class="input-control" name="username" pattern="[a-z0-9._-]{3,60}" required placeholder="contoh: teller.mc01"><small class="field-help">Huruf kecil, angka, titik, underscore, atau tanda hubung.</small></div><div class="field-group"><label>Role <span>*</span></label><select class="input-control" name="role" required><?php foreach ($rules['roles'] as $role => $label): ?><option value="<?= mc_e($role) ?>" <?= $role === 'teller' ? 'selected' : '' ?>><?= mc_e($label) ?></option><?php endforeach; ?></select></div><div class="field-group"><label>Password awal <span>*</span></label><input class="input-control" type="password" name="password" minlength="3" required autocomplete="new-password" placeholder="Minimal 3 karakter"></div><button class="btn btn-primary btn-full" type="submit">＋ Buat Pengguna</button></form></section>
<section class="panel user-list-panel"><div class="panel-heading"><div><h2>Daftar Pengguna</h2><p><?= number_format(count($users), 0, ',', '.') ?> akun terdaftar</p></div></div><div class="table-scroll"><table class="data-table"><thead><tr><th>Pengguna</th><th>Username</th><th>Role</th><th>Status</th><th>Login terakhir</th><th>Aksi</th></tr></thead><tbody><?php foreach ($users as $item): ?><tr><td><div class="user-table-name"><?php $itemProfilePhoto = mc_profile_photo_path($item['profile_photo'] ?? ''); if ($itemProfilePhoto !== ''): ?><img class="user-avatar small-avatar user-avatar-photo" src="<?= mc_e($itemProfilePhoto) ?>" alt="Foto <?= mc_e($item['full_name']) ?>"><?php else: ?><span class="user-avatar small-avatar user-avatar-default" aria-label="Ikon pengguna default"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="8" r="4"></circle><path d="M4 21a8 8 0 0 1 16 0"></path></svg></span><?php endif; ?><div><strong><?= mc_e($item['full_name']) ?></strong><?php if ((int) $item['must_change_password'] === 1): ?><small>Menunggu ganti password</small><?php endif; ?></div></div></td><td><code><?= mc_e($item['username']) ?></code></td><td><?= mc_e($rules['roles'][$item['role']] ?? $item['role']) ?></td><td><span class="status-pill <?= (int) $item['is_active'] === 1 ? 'status-active' : 'status-inactive' ?>"><?= (int) $item['is_active'] === 1 ? 'Aktif' : 'Nonaktif' ?></span></td><td><?= $item['last_login'] ? mc_e(date('d M Y H:i', strtotime($item['last_login']))) : 'Belum login' ?></td><td><?php if ((int) $item['id'] !== (int) $user['id']): ?><form method="post" onsubmit="return confirm('Ubah status akun pengguna ini?');"><?= mc_csrf_field() ?><input type="hidden" name="action" value="toggle_user"><input type="hidden" name="user_id" value="<?= (int) $item['id'] ?>"><button class="btn btn-sm <?= (int) $item['is_active'] === 1 ? 'btn-danger-light' : 'btn-secondary' ?>" type="submit"><?= (int) $item['is_active'] === 1 ? 'Nonaktifkan' : 'Aktifkan' ?></button></form><?php else: ?><span class="muted-inline">Akun Anda</span><?php endif; ?></td></tr><?php endforeach; ?></tbody></table></div></section></div>
<section class="security-callout user-note"><span>i</span><p>Role menentukan menu dan tindakan yang tersedia ketika RBAC aktif. Untuk mengubah aturan role, edit matriks izin pada tabel <code>role_permissions</code> atau tambahkan antarmuka pengelolaan role pada pengembangan berikutnya.</p></section>
